---
description: "Quality gates for workshop content: correctness, clarity, accessibility, performance."
globs: "{slides.md,pages/**/*.md,components/**/*.vue,snippets/**/*.{ts,js},docs/**/*.md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Quality gates (must hold)

- **Correctness**:
  - Code examples must compile/run when presented as runnable.
  - Commands in docs must match `package.json` scripts.
- **Clarity**:
  - Prefer fewer concepts per slide; use progressive disclosure.
  - Avoid excessive text density; optimize for workshop pacing.
- **Accessibility**:
  - Images must have `alt`.
  - Avoid color-only cues; keep contrast reasonable.
- **Performance**:
  - Avoid heavy components or large inline assets that slow slide navigation.
  - Prefer importing code from `snippets/` instead of repeating huge blocks.

